ubuntu-gaming-mode (2.5.0-5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Retain the validated Gamescope 3.16.30 GBM runtime and nine-patch source.
  * Add GPU/Vulkan inventory, HDR/VRR preferences and capability diagnostics.
  * Bundle native RADV VRS support and opt-in AMD/NVIDIA Vulkan VRS layers
    built for 32- and 64-bit applications.
  * Stage selected VRS layers from the readable package payload, keeping
    private installation state inaccessible to the Steam session.
  * Bundle the optional Bluetooth controller-wake app, icon, Polkit policy and
    service; recommend BlueZ and keep the option disabled by default.

 -- N3ruk <csz_11@hotmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200

ubuntu-gaming-mode (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the reproducible Gamescope 3.16.30 GBM runtime and nine-patch source record.
  * Add the optional console-style physical power-button integration.
  * Add an optional reversible /usr/local/bin/gamescope link to UGM's runtime.
  * Preserve Desktop power-button handling outside managed Gaming Mode.
  * Extend diagnostics, rollback and clean-install validation for 2.0.0.

 -- N3ruk <csz_11@hotmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
